{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/0d37cf51d6a8397076511b53625dc2cc.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dragon-riding extraction ARPG with castle building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is a mission-based dragon riding ARPG. Take on dangerous excursions across the war-torn Azarkeen region, fighting on dragonback and on foot to seize loot and relics. Then <strong>extract back to your castle island</strong>, where you expand your town, craft gear, and upgrade your warriors for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a risk\u2013reward run: push deeper for better rewards, or extract early to secure what you\u2019ve found. Play fully <strong>solo</strong> or team up in <strong>online co-op</strong>; your progress and castle carry across both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is NOT always online. You can run a dedicated server yourself, or play on many freely provided official servers.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ride and fight on dragons</strong> \u2013 Soar over battlefields, strafe enemies with fire, then dive into brutal close-quarters combat as a dragon rider.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mission-based extraction loop</strong> \u2013 Choose your mission, hunt for loot and materials, then extract safely or risk  going deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rebuild Dragonhold castle</strong> \u2013 Restore a ruined stronghold and surrounding town; unlock vendors, crafting stations, and new progression systems as you rebuild.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade</strong> \u2013 Forge weapons, armor, and arcane relics. Grow your dragon\u2019s power and your own build with skills and gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and elite encounters</strong> \u2013 Take on challenging bosses both on dragonback and on foot, learning patterns and coordinating with allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/65dedf0328e012b58c92212e4b2cdce5.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies on a mighty dragon and unleash fiery attacks on your enemies. Explore a vast enchanted realm and save the people of Azarkeen. Unleash deadly abilities and magical powers to prevent a corrupt holy war spreading across the world. Restore the balance in spectacular third-person action in solo or multiplayer modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is <strong>fully playable solo from start to finish</strong> \u2013 you don\u2019t need other players or a constant online population to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play offline / privately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Host your own dedicated server </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Or join freely provided official servers for co-op sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is there if you want it; the entire experience can be enjoyed as a single-player ARPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/1d47c41772fae20394ef72abe168e042.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f30965f30b815cc22f029990ec49babe.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f9f6f25ae6d935ade682bb90dbd55f99.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become a member of the legendary Boundless Order, harnessing the power of dragons and etching your name into the annals of history? Your destiny awaits in Dragonhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1510330?t=1770485289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770485289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/cdf9eed59b6c0fe182a544b6f758b89e198f2a4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770485289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/cdf9eed59b6c0fe182a544b6f758b89e198f2a4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770485289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The mature content relates directly to fighting and killing monsters."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/df413079de90e82ea06f3a6beb6f7244.avif?t=1770485289\" width=1560 height=2316 /></span></p></p><br><h1>FAQ</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Can I play this fully solo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>: Yes. Dragonhold is fully playable as a single-player ARPG; co-op is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this pay-to-win?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> No. All gameplay content and progression systems are included in the base game. We only sell a few optional cosmetic skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: What are the In-App Purchases .MTX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A:\u00a0 You can play the full experience from start to finish with the base purchase. We offer a <strong>small number of optional cosmetic skins</strong> for players who want to support development further. They don\u2019t affect stats or progression in any way and never will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this game &quot;always on&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: No, you  play solo and offline whenever you like, and only online if you want to.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Will you abandon Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Our team has been building Dragonhold for years, and we\u2019re committed to a full 1.0 release. We share our roadmap publicly and ship regular updates based on community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this an open world game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong>\u00a0Dragonhold has multiple large open world areas, it takes about 30+ minutes on foot, but it\\s much faster on Dragonback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/0d37cf51d6a8397076511b53625dc2cc.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dragon-riding extraction ARPG with castle building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is a mission-based dragon riding ARPG. Take on dangerous excursions across the war-torn Azarkeen region, fighting on dragonback and on foot to seize loot and relics. Then <strong>extract back to your castle island</strong>, where you expand your town, craft gear, and upgrade your warriors for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a risk\u2013reward run: push deeper for better rewards, or extract early to secure what you\u2019ve found. Play fully <strong>solo</strong> or team up in <strong>online co-op</strong>; your progress and castle carry across both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is NOT always online. You can run a dedicated server yourself, or play on many freely provided official servers.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ride and fight on dragons</strong> \u2013 Soar over battlefields, strafe enemies with fire, then dive into brutal close-quarters combat as a dragon rider.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mission-based extraction loop</strong> \u2013 Choose your mission, hunt for loot and materials, then extract safely or risk  going deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rebuild Dragonhold castle</strong> \u2013 Restore a ruined stronghold and surrounding town; unlock vendors, crafting stations, and new progression systems as you rebuild.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade</strong> \u2013 Forge weapons, armor, and arcane relics. Grow your dragon\u2019s power and your own build with skills and gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and elite encounters</strong> \u2013 Take on challenging bosses both on dragonback and on foot, learning patterns and coordinating with allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/65dedf0328e012b58c92212e4b2cdce5.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies on a mighty dragon and unleash fiery attacks on your enemies. Explore a vast enchanted realm and save the people of Azarkeen. Unleash deadly abilities and magical powers to prevent a corrupt holy war spreading across the world. Restore the balance in spectacular third-person action in solo or multiplayer modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is <strong>fully playable solo from start to finish</strong> \u2013 you don\u2019t need other players or a constant online population to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play offline / privately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Host your own dedicated server </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Or join freely provided official servers for co-op sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is there if you want it; the entire experience can be enjoyed as a single-player ARPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/1d47c41772fae20394ef72abe168e042.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f30965f30b815cc22f029990ec49babe.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f9f6f25ae6d935ade682bb90dbd55f99.avif?t=1770485289\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.poster.avif?t=1770485289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.webm?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.mp4?t=1770485289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become a member of the legendary Boundless Order, harnessing the power of dragons and etching your name into the annals of history? Your destiny awaits in Dragonhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_